momentum space. Thus, the altermagnet creates an
anisotropy on the pairing correlations. This anisotropy
will lead to a spatially nonuniform distribution of spinpolarized triplet correlations around the wall, as is visible
in Fig. 3(b,d). We will refer to the associated points on
